certificate of registration or has been blacklisted by any Government authority or regulator or an order of restraint,
debarment, prohibition or any order of such like nature has been passed against it or such retirement adviser or any of
its principal officer has been convicted by a court of law for commission of economic offences or involving any moral
turpitude;
(g)
if retirement adviser submits to the Authority a false statement or information which has a material effect on the rights,
